 device has multiple functionalities - from viewing your current health level to browsing through your inventory","trSats":"For easier aiming you can use Stable-Tec Arcane Targeting Spell (S.A.T.S.). To do this press Sats (or middle mouse button by default)","trChWeap":"You can switch weapons using PipBuck, numeric buttons or ScrUp and ScrDown (or scrolling by default)","trMont":"A crowbar! You can use it as a weapon and to break stuff as well","trScrew":"A screwdriver! Quite a useful tool. It can help you open simple locks. Try it on that chest","trRech":"Self-charging pistol - a lucky prize. It belongs to magical energy weapons class, that does not need Spark-batteries. The charge is restored automatically over time","trFirearms":"Firearms - you can never get enough of those. Press Reload to reload","trMagic":"You found a book describing spell \"Telekinetic bullet\". To use it, equip it like an ordinary weapon. Spells don`t require ammo, but consume your magical power","trTerm":"Do not ignore terminals. Some of them may contain valuable data, other can control doors locks, mechanisms, and security systems. Protected terminals can be hacked","trScheme":"You found schematics for a hoof-made weapon. If you have all necessary components, you can try creating this weapon at the workbench","trRun":"You can jump over this pit, but you will have to run to gain speed and jump right at the edge. Hold Run while running and jumping to move faster and to jump further!","trPl":"In case you can`t make it, this thing here will help you this time. But seriously, it is not that hard!","trFloat":"Looks like you`ll have to swim. Press and hold Jump to swim upwards and jump out of the water","trZoom":"Hold Look and move cursor to move camera. Press Zoom to change zoom","perkLevit":"You got the ability Double Jump","trLevit":"While jumping, press Jump again to jump off air with telekinesis. Using this technique you can jump much further","trLevitUp":"You can also use a double jump to get into hard-to-reach places","trVlaz":"Hold BeUp + Right(Left) to climb one block high without jumping, or climb through narrow passages at the level of one block","trExit":"Go left to continue exploring the complex. Or go right to go to the surface","trRad":"Don`t stay long in places with high background radiation, especially don`t linger near magical radiation waste unless you want to experience deadly radiation sickness","trAntirad":"Use RadAway to remove magical radiation from your body. Using healing potions won`t help here","trFast":"Run faster here (holding Run) and you won`t fall","trDiagon":"While moving, hold BeUp to go upstairs","trWeaponUp":"Hold BeUp to raise your weapon higher. You can activate the red button by shooting it","trStairs":"Press BeUp to grab the ladder in a jump","trLurk":"You can hide in wall niches, behind crates and furniture. While you are under cover you get bonuses to stealth and evasion. To hide, stand in front of a cover and press BeUp","trSneak":"It is not necessary to fight every enemy, some of them can be avoided. Wait when enemy looks away, then try to pass unnoticed. Use the wall niche to hide","trStJump":"Holding Left or Right, press Jump to jump off the ladder to the left or to the right, respectively","trStDown":"Press Jump to jump down off the ladder","trShelf":"Press Sit twice to jump off the beam. While falling, hold Sit to pass through other beams","trDash":"Holding Run, quickly tap Left or Right twice to dash. This trick might help you reach certain places, and you may also use it in a fight","trDash2":"While holding Run, quickly press Left or Right twice to dash. By making a dash toward the attacking enemy, you can avoid taking damage"}}